the
boundary
between mucosa and skin; it is similar to the eyelids,
labia minora, anus and lips. The male prepuce also
provides adequate mucosa and skin to cover the entire
penis during erection. The unique innervation of the
prepuce establishes its function as an erogenous tissue
[8].
Ritualistic
circumcision
involves
the
involuntary
