FACT: The consumer of a neonatal circumcision is the infant who is circumcised, not
the parent(s) who requested and/or paid for the circumcision. Body ownership rights
are now being introduced as an issue in circumcision lawsuits that claim that every
human being has an inherent, inalienable right to his own intact body (61, 62). These
