Male Circumcision:
Pain, Trauma and
Psychosexual Sequelae
GREGORY J. BOYLE
Bond University, Australia
RONALD GOLDMAN
Circumcision Resource Center, Boston, USA
J. STEVEN SVOBODA
Attorneys for the Rights of the Child, Berkeley, USA
