Newly circumcised boys may suffer sleep disturbances with periods of abnormally prolonged NREM sleep, 
increased wakefulness and inability to sleep, difficulties in feeding, and interference with the mother-infant 
bonding [20]. Also, in a large scale study (N = 3253) in the Philippines, Ramos and Boyle [156] found that al-
