23 Id.; Hodges, F. M., Svoboda, J. S., & Van Howe, R. S. (2002). Prophylactic interventions on children: balancing 
human rights with public health. Journal of Medical Ethics, 28(1), 1-16.
24 See infra Part IV at 15-17.
25 See, e.g., He who avers must prove, Mills & Reeve LLP (U.K., August 22, 2013).
