Christakis, D. A., Harvey, E., Zerr, D. M., Feudtner, C., Wright, J. A., Connell, F. A.: A trade-off analysis of routine 
newborn circumcision. Pediatrics. 2000;105(1 pt 3):246–249. 
77 Doctors Opposing Circumcision, Commentary on American Academy of Pediatrics 2012 Circumcision Policy 
Statement. <http://www.doctorsopposingcircumcision.org/pdf/2013-04-24_Commentary.pdf> ("DOC Critique".)
