3. Uberoi M, Abdulcadir J, Ohl DA, et al. Potentially under-
recognized late-stage physical and psychosexual complications of 
non-therapeutic neonatal penile circumcision: a qualitative and 
quantitative analysis of self reports from an online community
forum. Int J Impot Res. 2022;35(3):1–8. https://doi.org/10.1038/ 
s41443-022-00619-8 
4. Buckler M. As controversies mount, circumcision policies need a 
rethink. J Med Ethics. Published online November 13, 2025;0:1–
